DreamTextInput:ErrorNode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:ErrorNode
    src   "The error message's paragraph. An OPTIONAL part: every template authored for this control\nbefore the error state existed has no node by that name, and a control that reported those as\nmissing would turn an addition into a warning on every existing asset."
    text  "错误消息所在的段落。属于可选部分：在错误状态存在之前为该控件制作的每个模板\n都没有该名称的节点，而把这种情况报告为缺失的控件\n会把一次新增变成针对每个现有资产的警告。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:ErrorText {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:ErrorText
    src   "The message in effect, empty when there is none.\n\nTransient and read-only, like the key selector's armed flag and for the same reason: an error\nis something that just happened to a value, not a property of the field, and a .dui able to\nauthor one would ship a screen that opens already complaining."
    text  "当前生效的消息，没有消息时为空。\n\n临时且只读，与按键选择器的 armed 标志一样，原因也相同：错误是\n刚刚发生在某个值上的事情，而不是字段的属性，因此若 .dui 能够\n编写它，发布的界面一打开就会报错。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:GetError {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:GetError
    src   "The error state, which UMG's text box has had since it existed and this one had not.\n\nA field that refused a value said nothing: the caller's only way to report it was a separate\nlabel somebody had to remember to place, colour and hide again. Slate answers this with an\nerror-reporting widget packed at the right of the box, and so does this: one text node, asleep\nwhile there is no error, right-aligned over the field in the style's error colour.\n\nThe message is CONTENT (which value is wrong), so it lives on the control; the colour is theme,\nso it lives in the style."
    text  "错误状态，UMG 的文本框自存在起就有，而这个控件此前没有。\n\n拒绝某个值的字段什么也不说：调用方唯一能报告它的方式，是另外放一个\n标签，还得有人记得去放置、着色并再次隐藏。Slate 用一个\n打包在框右侧的错误报告控件来回答这一点，这里也一样：一个文本节点，在没有错误时\n处于休眠状态，右对齐覆盖在字段上，使用样式中的错误颜色。\n\n消息是内容（哪个值不对），所以它位于控件上；颜色是主题，\n所以它位于样式中。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:GetFont {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:GetFont
    src   "The typeface this field draws with -- UMG's GetFont/SetFont, minus the two things FSlateFontInfo\npacks in beside it: the size is Style.FontSize and the outline is in the text style.\n\nReads and writes Style.Font, so it obeys StyleSource like every other piece of the look: on a\nfield taking its style from the project sheet, the sheet's font is the answer."
    text  "此字段绘制所用的字体——即 UMG 的 GetFont/SetFont，但不含 FSlateFontInfo\n一并打包的另外两项：字号是 Style.FontSize，描边则在文本样式中。\n\n读写 Style.Font，因此它和其他外观项一样遵循 StyleSource：当字段\n从项目样式表取样式时，答案就是样式表中的字体。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:GetFontMaterial {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:GetFontMaterial
    src   "The material the glyphs are drawn with -- UMG's SetFontMaterial, with one difference worth\nknowing: it is ONE material for the whole paragraph rather than one for the font face, because\nthat is what the text renderer takes."
    text  "绘制字形所用的材质——即 UMG 的 SetFontMaterial，但有一处区别值得\n留意：它是整个段落的同一个材质，而不是每个字体面一个，因为\n文本渲染器接受的就是这样。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:GetHintText {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:GetHintText
    src   "UMG's HintText, which is this control's Placeholder under the name a UMG reader looks for.\nForwards; there is one string and one writer, so the two spellings cannot drift apart."
    text  "UMG 的 HintText，也就是本控件的 Placeholder，只是用了 UMG 使用者所熟知的名字。\n仅作转发：只有一个字符串、一个写入方，两种写法不会走样。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:GetInputType {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:GetInputType
    src   "The behaviour's knobs, with setters that REACH it.\n\nEvery one of these was already an authored property, and every one of them was already pushed\nin ApplyStyle -- so a .dui line and a Blueprint default worked. What did not work was writing\none at runtime: nothing in this family re-derives a control from a property that moved, so a\nBlueprint Set node changed the variable and the field went on behaving exactly as before."
    text  "该行为的各个可调项，其设置器能真正作用到它。\n\n其中每一项原本就已是可编辑属性，每一项原本也都在 ApplyStyle 中推送\n——所以 .dui 里的一行和蓝图默认值都能生效。不生效的是在运行时\n写入：这一族控件不会因属性变动而重新派生控件，所以\n蓝图 Set 节点只改了变量，字段的行为依旧如初。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:GetIsPassword {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:GetIsPassword
    src   "UMG's IsPassword, which here is DisplayType's two answers under the name UMG gives them."
    text  "UMG 的 IsPassword，在这里是 DisplayType 的两个答案，只是沿用了 UMG 给它们的名字。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:IgnoreKeys {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:IgnoreKeys
    src   "Keys the field must not swallow while it is edited -- the arrows, say, where the pad's arrows should leave\nthe field. Tab needs no entry: it ends the edit and moves on by itself (see bTabTypesTabCharacter)."
    text  "编辑时字段不得吞掉的按键——比如方向键，此时手柄的方向键应当离开\n该字段。Tab 无需列入：它会结束编辑并自行移走（见 bTabTypesTabCharacter）。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:InputType {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:InputType
    src   "Which characters the field accepts. Standard accepts anything."
    text  "字段接受哪些字符。Standard 接受任意字符。"
