    src   "The language the field is typed in, as a culture name (\"ja\", \"zh-Hans\"); empty is the game's. Picks the font's\nfallbacks meant for it and the forms a script draws per language -- see UDreamText::Language. Like the flow\ndirection, it is the whole field's: the placeholder and the error message read it too."
    text  "字段输入所用的语言，以文化名表示（“ja”、“zh-Hans”）；留空则用游戏的语言。它决定选用为该语言准备的字体\n回退，以及脚本按语言绘制的字形——见 UDreamText::Language。与文本流向\n一样，它作用于整个字段：占位符和错误消息也会读取它。"
