DreamTextInput:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet\nactually exists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect -- which is why\nit stays editable instead of being gated on the enum: the old edit condition greyed the\nexact values that were driving the control."
    text  "此实例自身的外观。当 StyleSource 如此指定且确实存在样式表时，\n项目样式表优先；项目中没有任何样式表时，这就是实际生效的外观——因此\n它保持可编辑，而不是由枚举控制：旧的编辑条件恰恰把\n正在驱动控件的那些值置灰了。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:TabSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:TabSize
    src   "Tab stops in spaces, from the line's start edge -- CSS tab-size, 8 as browsers have it."
    text  "制表位以空格计，从行的起始边缘算起——即 CSS 的 tab-size，与浏览器一样为 8。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:Text {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:Text
    src   "Authored text in; mirror of the field's out. A property so .dui and bindings can see it.\n\nBlueprintSetter, like the two below it: nothing in this family re-derives a control from a\nproperty that moved (the SynchronizeProperties tax UDreamUIControl documents), so a runtime\nwrite straight onto the variable changed the string and left the field showing the old one."
    text  "写入的编辑文本；镜像该字段的输出。设为属性，以便 .dui 和绑定可以访问。\n\n与下面两个一样是蓝图设置器（BlueprintSetter）：此系列中没有任何代码会因属性\n变动而重新推导控件（即 UDreamUIControl 文档中所述的 SynchronizeProperties 开销），因此运行时\n直接写入变量只会改变字符串，而字段仍显示旧值。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:TextFlowDirection {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:TextFlowDirection
    src   "Which way the paragraph reads -- the half of UMG's ShapedTextOptions that means anything here.\n\nAuto asks the bidi algorithm, which is what the field always did and therefore the default. The\nother two state it outright, for a screen that already knows its culture. UMG's other half,\nTextShapingMethod, has no home on a widget in this library: whether the shaper runs at all is\ndecided when the plugin is compiled (WITH_HARFBUZZ), not per control."
    text  "段落的阅读方向——UMG 的 ShapedTextOptions 中在此真正有意义的那一半。\n\nAuto 会询问双向文本算法，这正是该字段一贯的行为，因此也是默认值。另外\n两个则直接指定方向，适用于已经明确自身文化的界面。UMG 的另一半\nTextShapingMethod 在本库的控件上没有容身之处：塑形器是否运行\n取决于插件编译时的设置（WITH_HARFBUZZ），而非按控件决定。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:TextJustify {
