    src   "Where a justified line gets its extra room. Read only with Justification Justify."
    text  "两端对齐的行从哪里获得额外空间。仅在 Justification 为 Justify 时读取。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:VirtualKeyboardDismissAction {
