    src   "What dismissing it means. TextCommitOnDismiss keeps what the field did."
    text  "触发关闭操作的事件。TextCommitOnDismiss 保持了该字段的原始行为。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:VirtualKeyboardOptions {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:VirtualKeyboardOptions
    src   "Platform options for that keyboard -- autocorrect and whatever the platform adds later.\n\nThe one knob on this control with no Blueprint accessor, and not by choice: FVirtualKeyboardOptions\nis a plain USTRUCT in Slate with no BlueprintType on it, so neither the property nor a setter\ncan cross into Blueprint. UMG's own editable text carries it the same way, for the same reason.\nThe designer, .dui and C++ all reach it."
    text  "该键盘的平台选项——自动更正，以及平台日后新增的任何内容。\n\n这是此控件上唯一没有蓝图访问器的参数，而且并非出于自愿：FVirtualKeyboardOptions\n是 Slate 中的普通 USTRUCT，未标注 BlueprintType，因此该属性和设置函数\n都无法跨入蓝图。UMG 自己的可编辑文本也出于同样的原因以相同方式承载它。\n设计器、.dui 和 C++ 都能访问它。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextInput:VirtualKeyboardTrigger {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTextInput.h#DreamTextInput:VirtualKeyboardTrigger
    src   "Which activations raise it. OnAllFocusEvents keeps what the field did."
